        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 144,
          "y": 68,
          "w": 346,
          "h": 36,
          "text": "STATION TRADE COMMISSION",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "空间站贸易委员会",
            "zh": "空间站贸易委员会"
          },
          "style": "header",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F",
          "id": "header"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 56,
          "y": 100,
          "w": 524,
          "h": 46,
          "text": "Wrist Comm Terminal Appraisal Guide",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "腕式通讯终端鉴定指南",
            "zh": "腕式通讯终端鉴定指南"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F",
          "id": "title"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 166,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 100,
          "text": "Wrist comm terminals are sold on every ring of the station. This guide fixes a fair market value for\nany of them.\n\nEvery terminal starts at 100¢. Condition, casing and the services enabled on it move the figure, but\nwhatever its state a terminal is never worth less than 40¢.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "腕式通讯终端在各环层都有流通。本指南用于确定任何一台终端的公平市场价值。\n\n所有终端的初始价值均为 100¢。品相、材质与所开通的服务都会影响其价格，但无论状况如何，最低价值为 40¢。",
            "zh": "腕式通讯终端在各环层都有流通。本指南用于确定任何一台终端的公平市场价值。\n\n所有终端的初始价值均为 100¢。品相、材质与所开通的服务都会影响其价格，但无论状况如何，最低价值为 40¢。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 286,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "Base and floor value",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "基础价值与最低价值",
            "zh": "基础价值与最低价值"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 320,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Read the three factors in order, then add them up.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "三项按顺序核定后相加。",
            "zh": "三项按顺序核定后相加。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 226,
          "y": 380,
          "w": 176,
          "h": 220,
          "sprite": "ill_wrist_relay",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
