          "y": 545,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 110,
          "text": "Cast iron reads cold and matte, with a broad soft highlight.\n\nGold plating reads warm, and the highlight falls away toward the edges; the grain of the base metal\nstill shows at the corners.",
