        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 204,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 96,
          "text": "A terminal that is new, gold-plated, and carries the satellite relay tag (alone or with encryption) is\ncalled a luxe kit, and adds a further 200¢.\n\nThe kit bonus is added once, after the three factors.",
